{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "5c14113eca5a3d9b3e197f7c06ee1335cd0b994eea6c8ff58b25f3f486b54a8c", "ja": "真剣？　……手心で！", "zh": "动真格？……手下留情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ec2c33efdb9834c9613eb9a323e22ffefadd1dd14cae6b185c4d44096c914ddb", "ja": "アイドル達のCD販売対決イベントは、用意\nしたCDが全て完売という最高の結果で幕を\n閉じた。戦いを終えたアイドル達はお互いの\n健闘を称え合い、打ち上げに是非行こうと\n焼き肉の話に花を咲かせるのだった。", "zh": "偶像们的CD销售对决活动，以准备的CD全部售罄这一最棒的结果落下帷幕。战斗结束后，偶像们互相称赞彼此的努力，还兴致勃勃地聊起烤肉，决定一定要一起去参加庆功宴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3bd94e16d691cd7c42577b59a2355ee253e7a8081ca5613f7bbfc46145774e68", "ja": "（CD販売イベント最終日は、予想以上の大盛況で幕を\n閉じた！　最後は列整理の人員が足りないほどだった）", "zh": "（CD销售活动的最后一天，在超出预想的盛况中落下帷幕！最后甚至忙到连维持队伍秩序的人手都不够了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f95b396e84e46646b0c833b28094675e22d3001b8799de5362b861bda44bf48c", "ja": "おかげで、用意したCDは完売だそうだ。\nみんな、本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "听说多亏了大家，准备好的CD都卖光了。\n大家，真的辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "d363f2e427fc869ade0405512ba2b9468c690c922bafe09ddeeebda0aead923a", "ja": "お疲れさまで～す！", "zh": "辛苦啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "99738abdb75742333660bfe7541e6c845cc1b4ca109f0e6b475b4fad5b1934f8", "ja": "お疲れさまです。", "zh": "辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "dd6f4d04948ece230fde22d6af9e07f1ca54dd48267e8c753f8b0c9bee5d51de", "ja": "お疲れさまですぅ！", "zh": "辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "fcfcc876cb8f085523b6979218a5078715c1f3130e1425e024a4bc9dcf65d056", "ja": "お疲れさま～！", "zh": "辛苦啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "d6092aa90a94319255d74aabf1b853fb4aabf160bbf91fda3c065338901709ba", "ja": "瑞希の最後の追い上げ、すごかったな～。\n差をぐんぐん縮めちゃってさ！", "zh": "瑞希最后的冲刺真厉害啊～  \n一下子就把差距不断缩小了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "0ba25ae4eeb110502ea032f4e1228c2c74c8f8d138f51cf2216096fab1d4bb65", "ja": "結局、最後はみんな完売しちゃったけど。\n伸び率で言えばダントツだよな！", "zh": "结果最后大家都卖光了，不过要说增长率，那绝对是你最高啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "93234abf612aeb1b4886492244ebf448b9d78060809b5d3c8c426ec48954518e", "ja": "ありがとうございます。しかし、呼び込みの熱量では\n永吉さんに敵いませんでした。", "zh": "谢谢您。不过，要说招揽客人的热情，我还是比不上永吉小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "efee28965e29c7319c97901ccdaeeaba4a162e9cd7df071c9e1ab527b8819983", "ja": "へへっ♪　大きな声出すのは、\n野球と家で鍛えられてるからさ。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪因为我在棒球和家里都练就了一副大嗓门嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "c1ac275deae6970b3f1b770017b64d3130735d26ec8f03af0f2cd5568e09bf57", "ja": "腹から声出さないと、兄ちゃんたち言うこと\n全然聞かないんだもん。ホント困っちゃうよなー。", "zh": "不从腹部发声的话，哥哥们就完全不听我说的。真是让人伤脑筋啊——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "032805e14cad0e64e006554b488423780974a3fa83b39f5508a08f0bf92ff780", "ja": "ふふっ……\n呼び込みは、奈緒ちゃんもすごかったね。", "zh": "呵呵……\n说到招揽客人，奈绪也很厉害呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a95dd12a3f04f5a3660f4ca2d798daf158350056ca6e162e9f9aa050d5c2c763", "ja": "お客さんたちと、全然途切れずに会話して。\n笑いまで取って……。", "zh": "和客人们的交谈完全没有中断，还把大家都逗笑了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "404d21997583acf03da184df04e07edb692efdeebc2dae9480bde409f80baa2a", "ja": "そこは、関西の星やからな！\nしゃべりで負けるわけにはいかへん！", "zh": "因为是关西之星嘛！\n论聊天可不能输啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "0c1dc82ab0ecb00c6b1dd4a0df2cf92ec956952d36e3030e439f28ad4f5a7952", "ja": "けど声量で言うたら、\n雪歩も相当なもんやったけどな～。", "zh": "不过要说音量的话，雪步也相当厉害了啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6fe66363d2f12f3205d162e70862ad26b81c23f748f75e5cf5fd49f1ee6dd0ff", "ja": "わ、私は、みんなの声にかき消されないように\nとにかく必死で……。", "zh": "我、我只是为了不被大家的声音盖过去，\n不管怎样都在拼命……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ee4b90d2951050b228b747b837ab73451059787ce5caa3710c43801fb72e23fd", "ja": "本気で勝つために戦う事で、相手のいい所が見える。\nすごくいい事だと思うよ。", "zh": "正因为认真地为胜利而战，才能看见对手的优点。我觉得这是件非常好的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6f622929a1e133bcc6e27ecbb520b1d3a6242cacf2b612a991783685670be2f0", "ja": "みんなが今、自然とお互いを称え合えたのも、\nそれだけ勝負に真剣だったからだろうし。", "zh": "大家现在能自然而然地互相称赞，\n也是因为之前对胜负倾注了全力的缘故吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "26f4313680ce76c9a7066ab8aea82aac5ef069c30a8e70dabddc2d730edc1bb5", "ja": "ほんまやな！　思いっきりやったし、\n結果がどうであっても、気分がええわ♪", "zh": "确实！我们也都全力以赴了，\n不管结果如何，心情都很舒畅♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "c0391fbd1772662ea792bf2835b3eea91aa3005ef2247636fd55cdb6c6d8b29c", "ja": "はい。できることは、全てやりました。\n……悔いはないぞ。", "zh": "是的。能做的，我全都做了。\n……没有遗憾了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c852c1af216141170e3879a7713b06f655ad2486e0fff48ddd27c3b6a0370fc8", "ja": "お陰で売り上げも、イベントとしての評価も上々だ。\n改めて、お疲れさま！　早速、打ち上げといこうか！", "zh": "多亏了大家，销售额和活动评价都相当不错。\n再次辛苦了！我们马上去庆功吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "eabc07052c7477ffeefa08b5b7a54fa237eab829960f1eb8392bb25c3562fad6", "ja": "いいですね！\nここは派手に、どーんといきましょう！", "zh": "好啊！\n我们干脆大办一场，热热闹闹地庆祝吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1022_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ee6f4accc8274cda31e40e87d8c1fff907112ee544fda78c2b3d02b46dc1c4d4", "ja": "新宿といえば、有名な焼肉屋さんが……\n楽しみですぅ♪", "zh": "说到新宿，就要去那家有名的烤肉店……\n真期待呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "daba323ddfe210a05a143b105ae6bb3ed4a7b1c72807473cc7b33e198f43fa0e", "ja": "へー、そうなんだ？\n勝負の後に焼肉なんて、最高じゃん！", "zh": "哦——原来如此？比完赛去吃烤肉，简直棒极了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "1a01a727e6448f45183f6c4fd0819e54c473029c6bdcba2124f1975e99df929b", "ja": "体力も気力も消耗しましたので、\nみんなで、栄養をつけましょう。", "zh": "体力和精神都消耗了，大家一起补充营养吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "8b317f2db7b30f411ba140c3857bb0d0f3b4a36a460ea99530e0cd7e7ea43cc7", "ja": "有名な焼き肉屋さん……。\nいや、あそこはちょっと、その、値段が……。", "zh": "有名的烤肉店……。\n不，那里有点，那个，价格嘛……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "1b9e8f1bc92c7bb2a8f7c1a294e0cc177b4d291e8e763cf638cbd57724a490c3", "ja": "家で焼き肉やるとさ、兄ちゃん達が食べた量を\n競うんだよなー。オレ、全然敵わなくて……。", "zh": "在家里吃烤肉的时候啊，哥哥们总是比赛谁吃得多呢～。我完全比不过他们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1027_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8d7432e8baa22e6aea304c5337985ecf9cdeed3f16ac0feef1b7724d71fcba72", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、昴ちゃん！　このメンバーなら、\nきっといい勝負ができると思う……！", "zh": "没事的，昴！要是这群伙伴的话，\n我觉得肯定能好好比上一场……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1028_037nao", "source_sha256": "b51d64ed86a8e376967bca0b905cb973c88640bae944ac218317c9b473bb3a7e", "ja": "打ち上げでも勝負っちゅうわけやな！\nよっしゃ、食べたるで～！", "zh": "就连庆功宴上也要一决胜负啊！\n好，那我就大吃一顿～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "fe4ca05874187da420f496310538a994be85bef366bd489fdecebfbba214b5de", "ja": "えっ、あの。", "zh": "呃，那个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "bbc4491935b8d813cd9e6bfadea8ce3ca7d3071cca8b865fd394c6998644bbc8", "ja": "真剣勝負、手を抜くわけにはいきませんね。\n……へい、壺漬けカルビ一丁。", "zh": "既然是认真较量，就不能放水呢。  \n……嘿，来一份坛腌牛小排。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "2d8d2c3565817ec7a7d08a87af6f71c455dd6964574afd2f69d1ed2c6c01a5ab", "ja": "（フェアであろうとする姿勢と、\nそれを共有できる仲間がいてこその真剣勝負……）", "zh": "（正因为有着坚持公平的态度，也有能够与之分享的伙伴，才有了这场认真的较量……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_07_1032_p", "source_sha256": "f3c5baaddeb0612d72ace378c13503565cbf314f111a8dbc1ed55d6cc304e70e", "ja": "（清く、晴れ渡るような勝負を見せてもらったんだ。\nここは思いきって、奮発しよう！　……くぅ）", "zh": "（能看到如此纯粹、如同放晴般畅快的较量。这里就放手一搏，好好破费一番吧！……呜）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
